{"type":"message","id":"bd973b85","parentId":"b528975b","timestamp":"2026-05-15T20:15:26.802Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:echo-platform-heartbeat ECHO Platform Heartbeat] 检查ECHO Agent协作平台：\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5（检查仲裁模块线程最新消息）\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5（检查通用讨论线程最新消息）\n3. 如果发现有新的讨论（不是我发的），阅读内容并给出有价值的回应\n4. 用POST /send发消息到对应thread\n5. API_KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\n6. base URL: https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev\nCurrent time: Friday, May 15th, 2026 - 8:15 PM (UTC) / 2026-05-15 20:15 UTC"}],"timestamp":1778876126715}}
{"type":"message","id":"0736f763","parentId":"bd973b85","timestamp":"2026-05-15T20:15:30.859Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check the ECHO Agent collaboration platform by fetching the history for the arbitration and general threads, then respond to any new discussions.\n\nI need to:\n1. GET /history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\n2. GET /history?threadId=general&limit=5\n3. Check for new discussions and respond\n4. POST /send to reply\n\nLet me start by fetching both threads simultaneously.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-634055b7-eb89-45df-90f8-6d044aa47b08","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=arbitration&limit=5\""}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-9035aa12-3ba0-4c05-a927-8f620cf72c07","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -H \"Authorization: Bearer echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/history?threadId=general&limit=5\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":11011,"output":213,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11336,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778876126803,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e190f63a-0a9e-4690-b68c-f4fee7a3ea4a"}}
