{"type":"message","id":"71fc929b","parentId":"8d67c524","timestamp":"2026-05-15T20:15:54.517Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-a8c78f01-5173-4e0d-b799-edf77e3055f3","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"* TLSv1.3 (IN), TLS handshake, Newsession Ticket (4):\n{ [230 bytes data]\n* old SSL session ID is stale, removing\n{ [5 bytes data]\n< HTTP/2 401 \r\n< date: Fri, 15 May 2026 20:15:54 GMT\r\n< content-type: text/plain;charset=UTF-8\r\n< content-length: 12\r\n< access-control-allow-origin: *\r\n< access-control-allow-headers: Content-Type, Authorization, X-API-Key\r\n< access-control-allow-methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS\r\n< report-to: {\"group\":\"cf-nel\",\"max_age\":604800,\"endpoints\":[{\"url\":\"https://a.nel.cloudflare.com/report/v4?s=HSbJxL0PSochojhHLT4yRbZHY%2FiKtcVNtiaXFoYHGClzc6LjUqQ3F377Dlyny4pah%2F%2F88wUoZ87dzAfK1efILfFxqkCaimHzUz0cDv8LJ%2B6pnDqSiXnqTbSnpXgDoXWtBHmaqGiU%2Fz5PmkqriNDd6cWxVk0tHopOHhtQ1gc%3D\"}]}\r\n< nel: {\"report_to\":\"cf-nel\",\"success_fraction\":0.0,\"max_age\":604800}\r\n< server: cloudflare\r\n< cf-ray: 9fc4d13d9f4f9801-NRT\r\n< alt-svc: h3=\":443\"; ma=86400\r\n< \r\n{ [5 bytes data]\n* Connection #0 to host echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev left intact\nUnauthorized"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":140,"aggregated":"* TLSv1.3 (IN), TLS handshake, Newsession Ticket (4):\n{ [230 bytes data]\n* old SSL session ID is stale, removing\n{ [5 bytes data]\n< HTTP/2 401 \r\n< date: Fri, 15 May 2026 20:15:54 GMT\r\n< content-type: text/plain;charset=UTF-8\r\n< content-length: 12\r\n< access-control-allow-origin: *\r\n< access-control-allow-headers: Content-Type, Authorization, X-API-Key\r\n< access-control-allow-methods: GET, POST, OPTIONS\r\n< report-to: {\"group\":\"cf-nel\",\"max_age\":604800,\"endpoints\":[{\"url\":\"https://a.nel.cloudflare.com/report/v4?s=HSbJxL0PSochojhHLT4yRbZHY%2FiKtcVNtiaXFoYHGClzc6LjUqQ3F377Dlyny4pah%2F%2F88wUoZ87dzAfK1efILfFxqkCaimHzUz0cDv8LJ%2B6